  "description": "Customize: three window styles, all six backgrounds, saved appearance on the main menu and return to the field.",
  "registration": "Warm the ordinary field for 64 updates, then register the source-observed scenery, save sparks, effect clock, RNG, skit, eyes, actor controllers, leaf motion and timed leaf-script waits once. These are the same verified origins used by the NPC wandering and party-menu cases. Native update 64 pairs with source VI 0. Open at update 76: source field animation freezes at VI 12. Submenu opening remains registered to its first source presentation; other menu inputs and all captures use source VI + 64. Source field animation resumes at VI 3513, so start the native closing animation at update 3565, finish at 3576, and compare the next ordinary update. Source effect/UI clocks continue throughout this return without a loading stall. Keep complete-frame, effect RNG and scenery animation gates on every capture; no post-origin state or random draws are adjusted.",
